HST Office: Word Range.Collapse, Duplicate, SetRange, MoveStart, MoveEnd, Paragraphs; First and Last.

Range.Collapse is how Word macros walk a document after a Find, and did not exist. Range.Paragraphs was
missing and Selection.Paragraphs only knew "the first paragraph". Paragraphs, Words and Sentences get
First and Last, which upstream's testSentences expects.

The new file is for HST Office under MPL-2.0, like the files around it.

License: these upstream files remain under their original license (MPL-2.0).
Test: tests/runtime/vba-corpus/regression_cases.py, upstream testSentences.docm.
